,"props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["找人替考、替别人考，都是犯罪，可能被判拘役、罚钱，靠替考当上公务员的被开除公职。组织作弊、卖答案，最重判 7 年。驾照考试也算，有驾校老板组织学员作弊被判了刑。没到犯罪的，成绩作废，还可能被停考或者一年内不能再考。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。别信「包过班」「VIP 通道」和卖答案的群。手机、耳机这类能收发信息的东西不带进考场。没考过就多准备一次。难在差几分就能上岸时，有人开价说能保过。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["刑法第二百八十四条之一管四种行为，前提是「法律规定的国家考试」。组织作弊的，判 3 年以下或者拘役，并处或者单处罚金。情节严重的，判 3 到 7 年。给组织者提供作弊器材或者别的帮助，按同一档判。为了作弊卖答案、给答案，也按同一档判。替别人考、找别人替自己考，是代替考试罪，处拘役或者管制，并处或者单…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：考公、考研、考驾照和考职业资格时，不替人考、不找人替考，不买卖答案，不帮人组织作弊"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"child